/**
 * NATIVEWIND TYPESCRIPT DECLARATION FILE
 * ========================================
 * 
 * PURPOSE: This file tells TypeScript that NativeWind types exist.
 * It enables TypeScript to understand the "className" prop on React Native components.
 * 
 * WHY WE NEED IT:
 * - Without this, TypeScript would show errors when using className="..."
 * - Enables autocomplete for Tailwind classes in VS Code
 * - Required for NativeWind v4+ to work with TypeScript
 * 
 * NOTE: This is a type declaration file (.d.ts) - it only contains type information,
 * no actual runtime code.
 */
/// <reference types="nativewind/types" />
